  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The Parts Velocity PDF prints the Description, Category and Vendor columns in full instead of shortening them to 18 characters. A description over a hundred characters long wraps onto several lines inside its cell, which makes the rows very tall and the page hard to read."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Parts Velocity."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Set the date range to This Year with both locations, Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 and Staging Lethbridge - 4310 selected, and type 179.YK5005 into the report's search box."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the three-dot menu and choose Download (PDF)."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the downloaded file and look at the Description and Category columns. That part's description is 117 characters long \u2014 CLEVIS KIT MERITOR TYPE 5/8\"Straight, 5/8in-18 Threads, 1/2in and 1/4in Pins, Pin C to C is 1-3/8in(E11430A, R810019) \u2014 and its category, HD-Air Brakes & Air Suspension, is 30."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The PDF prints the whole description and the whole category. Shortened to eighteen characters they would have read CLEVIS KIT MERITOR and HD-Air Brakes & Ai."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Nothing is being shortened at all \u2014 a much shorter description, Brake & Parts Cleaner at 21 characters, is also printed in full. Part # is correctly left alone, the PDF is correctly A3 landscape and titled Parts Velocity, and the shop logo prints. The spreadsheet is supposed to carry the full text and does."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "In the PDF, Description, Category and Vendor are shortened to 18 characters. Part # is not shortened, and the spreadsheet keeps the full text."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Parts Velocity report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/620888066/Parts+Velocity+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 5, requirement S6-R6: \u201cThe PDF is formatted for A3 landscape, titled Parts Velocity. In the PDF, Description, Category, and Vendor are truncated to 18 characters. Part # is not truncated. The CSV carries the full, untruncated Description / Category / Vendor values.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
